      "sha": "328c3c770ac9898b975341bb3da6b8850b7f1194",
      "message": "Add GitHub Actions workflow to mirror to Launchpad\n\nAdds .github/workflows/mirror-lauchpad.yml which mirrors the repository to Launchpad on a weekly schedule (Sundays 00:00 UTC) and via manual dispatch. The job checks out the repo, configures an SSH key from secrets.LAUNCHPAD_SSH_KEY, updates known_hosts, adds a 'launchpad' remote (git+ssh://solarispkn@git.launchpad.net/~solarispkn/+git/SolarisPKN-Labs) and force-pushes all branches and tags. Ensure the LAUNCHPAD_SSH_KEY secret is configured and the remote URL matches the intended Launchpad target.",
